apps/demo/database.db
apps/demo/database.db-shm
apps/demo/database.db-wal

# Ephemeral drizzle config/schema generated by `astromech db:generate`
**/.astromech/

# Personal scratch / pre-thinking doc — not part of the repo
NEXT.md

# Turborepo: per-package task logs and run summaries (the cache lives in the git directory)
.turbo/
